  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# ☂️ [[Part 2 AI System Design|AI System Design]]\nThe umbrella: twelve ribs held up by the fundamentals of [[Part 1 System Design|system design]], standing on business goals. **Click any name** to open its note.",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": -900,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 150
    },
    {
      "id": "n000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**🧩 Data Sources**\n[[Data Sources]] — Where an AI system's data comes from: databases, APIs, streams, files, devices.",
      "x": 40,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#C0392B"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**🧩 AI Model Types**\n[[AI Model Types]] — The main families of models and what each is good for.",
      "x": 790,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#C0392B"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**🧩 Cloud & Infrastructure**\n[[Cloud & Infrastructure]] — The machines, chips and cloud services AI runs on.",
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#C0392B"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**👥 Users & Applications**\n[[AI System Design Overview]] — Users & applications: web, mobile, APIs and internal tools.",
      "x": 2290,
      "y": -680,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#C0392B"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ☂️ [[The 12 Ribs]]",
      "x": 1300,
