    },
    {
      "id": "n000021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**12**\n[[Ethics & Governance]]",
      "x": 2750,
      "y": -140.88419075520832,
      "width": 230,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#2E86DE"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000023",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🦯 The handle: fundamentals\n- 📖 [[Foundations]]\n- 🏛️ [[Architecture]]\n- 📈 [[Scalability]]\n- 🚀 [[Production]]\n\nEvery AI note's **🧱 Builds on** section points back here.",
      "x": 1330,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 360
    },
    {
      "id": "n000026",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🎯 [[Business Goals & Requirements]]\nUse cases · constraints · success metrics · stakeholders",
      "x": 1170,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 110,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000028",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[AI Architecture Layers|Data Layer]]**\nIngestion · processing · storage · feature store",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000029",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[AI Architecture Layers|Model Layer]]**\nTraining · fine-tuning · registry · evaluation",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n00002a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[AI Architecture Layers|Serving Layer]]**\nAPIs · inference · load balancing · autoscaling",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n00002b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[AI Architecture Layers|Monitoring Layer]]**\nLogs & metrics · drift · alerts · improvement",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 760,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n00002f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### 🏛️ [[AI Architecture Layers]]",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 690,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 50,
      "color": "#1F4FD8"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000030",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[Context Engineering]]**\nDeciding exactly what goes into a model's input so it answers well.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -380,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[Embeddings & Vector Databases]]**\nTurning meaning into numbers so you can search by similarity.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -240,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000032",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[Retrieval-Augmented Generation]]**\nLetting a model look things up before it answers.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[LLM Inference & Optimization]]**\nMaking large models answer fast and cheaply.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000034",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[AI Agents & Tool Use]]**\nModels that plan, call tools and take steps toward a goal.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000035",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[[Guardrails & AI Safety]]**\nChecks around a model that keep its inputs and outputs safe.",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 320,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000036",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🤖 [[Modern LLM Systems]]",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -500,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 90,
      "color": "#8E44AD"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000037",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🎓 [[Capstone - AI Support Assistant|Capstone]]\nOne AI system designed end to end, using every rib.",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "#16A085"
    },
    {
      "id": "n000038",
